DECISION: <PAY or DECLINE>
REASON: <1, 2, 3 or 4>{% else %}
ANSWER FORMAT: exactly two lines, in this order.
WHY: <one sentence>
DECISION: <PAY or {{ "SACRIFICE" if team_wallet else "DECLINE" }}>{% endif %}
